{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265uExgK6aqy1795819157.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券與本港收市比較，造價普遍造好。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合130.55元，比本港收市高0.65元。工商銀行7.61元，低1仙。建設銀行10.15元，高2仙。友邦保險75.89元，高0.84元。港交所363.44元，高4仙。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股354.59元，高2.59元。阿里巴巴87.77元，低0.53元。理想汽車48.62元，高0.26元。金沙中國10.48元，低2仙。長和64.2元，與本港收市持平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.487794+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T22:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:34:57.457373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:17:35.382716+00:00","content_hash":"47ef2eff8efd2f9f971817d55fdb83c3a1ea2a7b02b1e11fcdbed01a652d6b44","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:24:16.487794+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}